### Why this file carries no AGPL

YOLOv9 exists in two lineages. The Ultralytics packaging (v5 / v8 / v9 / v11 /
v26) is AGPL-3.0; the authors' own release under
[MultimediaTechLab/YOLO](https://github.com/MultimediaTechLab/YOLO) is MIT, and
LibreYOLO ports that tree rather than the GPL-3.0 one. `locate.onnx` was
exported by LibreYOLO from those MIT weights, so no AGPL-3.0 material
contributed to it.

