The ONNX metadata declares `box_format: xyxy`, `nc: 1`, `imgsz: 320`. LibreYOLO
bakes box decoding into the graph, so the output is corner format
`(x1, y1, x2, y2)` instead of the anchor encoding `(cx, cy, w, h)` that
Ultralytics exports produce. `solver._box_format()` reads that field and
rejects any model that does not declare it — it does not guess.
